{"route":"/karnal/services-farmhouse-interior-designer","city":"karnal","nested":false,"meta":{"og":{"type":"website","site_name":"9th-Corner","title":"Farmhouse Interior Designer in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"9th Corner is a farmhouse interior designer in Karnal, creating open, warm farmhouses with custom furniture, landscaping and lighting.","url":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-farmhouse-interior-designer","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg","image:width":"1200","image:height":"630"},"twitter":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Farmhouse Interior Designer in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"9th Corner is a farmhouse interior designer in Karnal, creating open, warm farmhouses with custom furniture, landscaping and lighting.","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg"},"title":"Farmhouse Interior Designer in Karnal | 9th Corner","robots":"index, follow","author":"9th-Corner","publisher":"9th-Corner","google-site-verification":"bFDxjFr1uDW3hEQ7YEzagKY9ZLzkrW1k1vtMcyQahyE","description":"9th Corner is a farmhouse interior designer in Karnal, creating open, warm farmhouses with custom furniture, landscaping and lighting.","keywords":"Farmhouse Interior Designer in Karnal, Best farmhouse interior designers in Karnal, Luxury farmhouse interior design Karnal, Rustic farmhouse interior designers in Karnal, Modern farmhouse interior design services in Karnal, Farmhouse living room interior designers in Karnal, Farmhouse bedroom interior design Karnal, Affordable farmhouse interior designers in Karnal, Farmhouse villa interior designers in Karnal, Farmhouse renovation designers in Karnal, Countryside farmhouse interior design experts, Farmhouse decor and styling services in Karnal, Turnkey farmhouse interior designers in Karnal, Nature-inspired farmhouse interior design Karnal, Large farmhouse interior designers in Karnal, Farmhouse kitchen interior design Karnal, Open-concept farmhouse interior designers in Karnal,","theme-color":"#0f141f","canonical":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-farmhouse-interior-designer"},"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ninth Corner\",\"9th-Corner\"],\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"image\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"logo\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"description\":\"As expert farmhouse interior designers in Karnal, we specialize in designing cozy, luxurious, and functional farmhouses that combine rustic charm with modern elegance. A farmhouse is more than a house—it’s a retreat, a space to relax, connect with nature, and enjoy life.\",\"telephone\":\"+91-9310582834\",\"email\":\"ninthcorner83@gmail.com\",\"priceRange\":\"$$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Pearls Best Heights I, 808, Netaji Subhash Place, Pitampura\",\"addressLocality\":\"Delhi\",\"postalCode\":\"110034\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Karnal\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/ninthcornerINC\",\"https://www.instagram.com/9thcorner.interiors/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/9th-corner-int/\",\"https://youtube.com/@9thcorner\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Farmhouse Interior Designer in Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-farmhouse-interior-designer\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you work as a farmhouse interior designer in Karnal?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Karnal and its surrounding villages have many farmhouses, and we design them as relaxed family homes or weekend retreats.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What materials suit a farmhouse in Haryana?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Stone, solid wood, terracotta, lime plaster and cotton or linen fabrics. They handle heat and dust well and age gracefully.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you plan outdoor kitchens and seating?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Verandas, outdoor kitchens, fire pits and garden seating are planned along with the interiors for family gatherings.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why hire a farmhouse interior designer instead of furnishing it yourself?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Farmhouses are large, and furniture alone does not make them comfortable. Planning layout, lighting and storage turns a big space into a usable home.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Farmhouse Interior Designer in Karnal, Haryana\",\"serviceType\":\"Farmhouse Interior Designer\",\"description\":\"9th Corner is a farmhouse interior designer in Karnal, creating open, warm farmhouses with custom furniture, landscaping and lighting.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-farmhouse-interior-designer\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Karnal, Haryana\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/tra5.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Farmhouse Interior Designer in Karnal, Haryana</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Farmhouses Across the Karnal Countryside</h2>\n            <p>As a farmhouse interior designer in Karnal, we specialize in curating farmhouse interiors that masterfully blend heritage rustic charm with contemporary comfort. Our architectural philosophy focuses on creating expansive, high-end retreats that harmonize with the surrounding nature while delivering the sophisticated amenities of a luxury modern residence.</p>\n            <p>Karnal is surrounded by fertile farmland, and many families here own farmhouses that are used every day, not just on weekends. Some are working farms with a family home; others are retreats or venues for functions. As a farmhouse interior designer, we shape every plan around daily use on the farm, from the tube-well shed to the guest bedroom.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Personalized Farmhouse Interiors</h2>\n            <p>\"From vaulted-ceiling living areas and chef-inspired open kitchens to serene master suites and wrap-around verandas, we design for the retreat lifestyle. By utilizing earthy tones, raw natural materials, and expansive glass facades, we create timeless farmhouses that offer a seamless indoor-outdoor transition.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Working Farm Homes</h3>\n                <p>On a working farm, the house must handle muddy boots, tractors in the yard and long days outdoors. We plan a mud room or wash area at the entry, sturdy floors that clean easily, a large kitchen for family and farm workers, and storage for seeds, tools and grain kept separate from living areas.</p><p>Bedrooms and the family lounge stay quiet and comfortable, away from farm activity.</p><p>A covered parking shed for tractors and cars keeps machinery out of the sun and rain.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Retreats and Function Farmhouses</h3>\n                <p>For farmhouses used for gatherings, a farmhouse interior designer plans large lawns, a covered hall for winter events, a catering kitchen, guest toilets and parking for many cars. Power and lighting are planned for tents, stages and music, so events do not depend on hired generators alone.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Materials for Rural Life</h3>\n                <p>Natural stone, terracotta tiles, exposed brick and solid wood suit the countryside and age well. Ceilings with fans and good cross-ventilation keep rooms cool in summer, while fireplaces or heaters warm them on foggy winter nights. Mosquito mesh, strong doors and outdoor lighting add comfort and security. We also plan water storage and solar power to cope with supply gaps.</p><p><b>Biophilic Spatial Planning:</b> Engineering airy, spacious layouts that maximize natural cross-ventilation and use large windows to frame the landscape as a living piece of art.</p><p><b>Rustic-Modern Fusion:</b> Integrating reclaimed wood, natural stone, and hand-forged metals with sleek contemporary furniture for a look that is both grounded and avant-garde.</p><p><b>Outdoor Synergy:</b> Designing patios, decks, and pergolas that act as natural extensions of the interior, doubling your usable living space for entertainment and relaxation.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>How We Manage a Farmhouse Project</h3>\n                <p>We visit the farm, walk the land and listen to how the family wants to use it. The farmhouse interior designer leading your project prepares a site plan, house layout and 3D views, with a budget broken into clear stages.</p><p>Local contractors and craftsmen work under our supervisor, and our senior team checks progress during planned visits from Delhi.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>A Farmhouse Interior Designer Who Understands Rural Life</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>Rural projects come with practical challenges: water, power, access roads and skilled labour. We plan for these from day one, so the build keeps moving. Our supervisor stays in touch with you by phone every day.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Proven Expertise in High-End Countryside & Farmhouse Architecture</strong>\n                    Experience with farm homes and countryside retreats.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Hyper-Customized Interiors Built Around Your Lifestyle Narratives</strong>\n                    Interiors built around your family's real routine.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Complete End-to-End Project Execution for a Stress-Free Handover</strong>\n                    Hands-on management until a stress-free handover.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Homes for Working Farms</strong>\n                    Mud rooms, storage and tough floors.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Self-Reliant Utilities</strong>\n                    Water storage and solar planned in.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to build your ultimate sanctuary? Partner with Karnal's premier farmhouse interior designer today.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Haryana</h2>\n                <p>City and town homes from our Haryana portfolio in Sonipat and Gurgaon.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/509.avif\" alt=\"Home interior in Sonipat, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Sonipat Home Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/72.avif\" alt=\"House interior in Bhiwani, Haryana by 9th Corner\" 